  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>As a Magic action while entirely within Dim Light or Darkness, you can expend 3 Focus Points to shroud yourself with shadows for 1 minute, until you have the Incapacitated condition, or until you end your turn in Bright Light. While shrouded by these shadows, you gain the following benefits.</p><p><strong>Invisibility.</strong> You have the Invisible condition.</p><p><strong>Partially Incorporeal.</strong> You can move through occupied spaces as if they were Difficult Terrain. If you end your turn in such a space, you are shunted to the last unoccupied space you were in.</p><p><strong>Shadow Flurry.</strong> You can use your Flurry of Blows without expending any Focus Points.</p><section id=\"secret-B7g3P8lqK1P97klf\" class=\"secret\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>This feature includes an Active Effect which will apply the Invisible condition to you.</p></section>",
      "chat": ""
    },
